Package: sublime-music
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: @RECOMMENDS@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://sublimemusic.app
Description: Native GTK3 Subsonic client (Plus fork)
 Sublime Music is a native GTK3 client for Subsonic-compatible music servers
 (Subsonic, Airsonic, Navidrome, Gonic, ...). It plays music locally through
 mpv or on Chromecast devices, integrates with MPRIS, caches songs for offline
 listening and shows the library by album, artist, folder, playlist or as one
 sortable song table.
 .
 This package was built from the Sublime Music (Plus) fork with the @FLAVOUR@
 dependency flavour (see the Makefile in the source tree).
